\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. All things bright and beautiful,
\par All creatures great and small,
\par All things wide and wonderful,
\par The Lord God made them all.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. Each little flower that opens,
\par Each little bird that sings,
\par He made their glowing colours,
\par He made their tiny wings.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Chorus\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par All things bright and beautiful,
\par All creatures great and small,
\par All things wide and wonderful,
\par The Lord God made them all.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. The purple-headed mountain,
\par The river running by,
\par The sunset, and the morning
\par That brightens up the sky.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Chorus\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par All things bright and beautiful,
\par All creatures great and small,
\par All things wide and wonderful,
\par The Lord God made them all.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4. The cold wind in the winter,
\par The pleasant summer sun,
\par The ripe fruits in the garden,
\par He made them every one.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Chorus\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par All things bright and beautiful,
\par All creatures great and small,
\par All things wide and wonderful,
\par The Lord God made them all.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 5\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 5. He gave us eyes to see them,
\par And lips that we might tell
\par How great is God Almighty,
\par Who has made all things well.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Chorus\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par All things bright and beautiful,
\par All creatures great and small,
\par All things wide and wonderful,
\par The Lord God made them all.
\par \f1 
